      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FANTASY FLIGHT (4) settled close to the pace then went to the lead and boxed on well to finish second in a 1690m race at this track last start, beaten 2.75 metres at his first run back from a spell. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Meets a comparable field so he can keep the ball rolling. CAPTAIN MILO (7) was out of the money two runs ago then broke and finished fifth last start over 2180m at this track, coming home 9 metres from the winner. Meets a similar line up so he is sure to be a force if the manners improve. AMADA VILLMA (9) is close to a win after two successive placings, the latest a third over 1690m at Shepparton. Great chance to break through. OUTPOST (1) should not have any excuses from the favourable draw.",
